h Pakistan.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How China buried Tibet flood images after Nepal disaster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:90f8d0ddda35e139b370b7824570166bae21105ac8fe7c13154c0a51f0f51f72</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:16:18Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472--01797a43cf24.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A flood has devastated communities along the China-Nepal border, but in Tibet the disaster was followed by a digital crackdown. Censors erased viral footage while state media flooded platforms with official content.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>At Venice Film Festival, politics take center stage</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:55ad2f87cdf8ab9705a80e4969702b115d35d067b90db37761f9f1d41eaf3abe</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:16:21Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/at-venice-film-festival-politics-take-center-stage/a-78493761--e7dc63ca25d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/at-venice-film-festival-politics-take-center-stage/a-78493761?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With works about Gaza, Ukraine and Elon Musk, political cinema is in the spotlight at the 2026 Venice Film Festival.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Deceived and deployed: How young Cameroonians end up fighting in Russia's war in Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:abe76c28e886a4957c5303bdea92a82185efa6b660d05910f38cbb97f5e4d4e0</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:16:24Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/deceived-and-deployed-how-young-cameroonians-end-up-fighting-in-russia-s-war-in-ukraine/a-78513256--92438951c44c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/deceived-and-deployed-how-young-cameroonians-end-up-fighting-in-russia-s-war-in-ukraine/a-78513256?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Analysts say economic desperation and fraudulent recruitment schemes are funneling Cameroonian youth into the Russian military — with deadly consequences. Does the Cameroonian government need to act more decisively?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Tariffs spat: Carney bets Canada can defy Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:90b4e6e7a743981d21668e2eedd8facddcc0ab9301ee29862416a6eae8afa276</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:16:27Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tariffs-spat-carney-bets-canada-can-defy-trump/a-78542754--a9c1a9cc9b04.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tariffs-spat-carney-bets-canada-can-defy-trump/a-78542754?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Canada is facing new US import penalties after Prime Minister Mark Carney refused to match US tariffs on China. Other countries are watching as the Trump trade clash turns into a fight over economic sovereignty.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>EU puts ChatGPT, Reddit and Roblox under stricter rules</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:82a0b84cac2ea4993c31767cbabdcd3c048c852a2a997f5f934df36ed8b5b7c4</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:16:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-puts-chatgpt-reddit-and-roblox-under-stricter-rules/a-78577019--bbb914338baf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-puts-chatgpt-reddit-and-roblox-under-stricter-rules/a-78577019?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">ChatGPT, Reddit and Roblox now have over 45 million ave